# Keep the build context to what the build needs. Anything listed here never reaches an image
# layer, which is the point for the first four: a secret or a repository history copied into a
# layer is in the image for good (CLAUDE.md §5.8).
.git
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tests, tooling and notes the runtime does not read.
**/e2e
docs
deploy/*.md
